	quest.2A02D797F5CABAD6.title: "Extrusion: Andesite"
	quest.2E5D835D2B5D7078.quest_desc: ["Andesite handles kinetic stress well, but fails quickly under liquid pressure and corrosion. Coating stripped wood in copper opens the door to the parallel branch of fluid engineering (Era 1.5)!"]
	quest.2E5D835D2B5D7078.quest_subtitle: "1x Copper Casing"
	quest.2E5D835D2B5D7078.title: "Watertight Frame: Copper Casing"
	quest.31AA7117F83F8B86.quest_desc: ["Your factory's tireless worker. The Deployer places components onto belts, wields tools, and assembles multi-stage mechanisms with pinpoint precision."]
